			<item>
				<title>Sendaway Begginer</title>
				<link>https://griz.sh/dogs/sendaway-begginer/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://griz.sh/dogs/sendaway-begginer/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;title is-1&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Sendaway&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Griz is getting to good enough where I can start increasing distance, and fading the lure. Denali on the other hand, doesn&amp;rsquo;t know this drill. She&amp;rsquo;s on a full on lure. Working this with a green dog might be a little harder than what you see here with Denali, but only because Denali has some experience learning from me already and she understands luring pretty well.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
